text:
Really good rogue metroidvania with a cool rune system where you can choose to either balance out a character's skill or max out one skill.
+It'll have you sinking in hundreds of hours if you want to fiil up the skill tree, but you my choose to finish it quicker if you don't;
+The art style is fitting and consistant;
+Interesting legacy system, where you choose one of 3 heirs after each death based on your playstyle;
+Turning medical conditions into power-ups and obstacles depending on playstyle;
+Controlls are super responsive, so the difficult dodging parts are fair;
+Organic difficulty, you can either win with lots of skill or spend hours levelling
+Having high level doesn't turn the first pats of the map into a borefest since the enemies scale with your level;
